 "notes": "Natural S45 WINTER (6 February 2035, owner 2026-10-06; bg_natural/S45.webp): frozen Vrbicke pleso on a clear cold day. Clouds drift over Chopok (winter sky mask), fine snow dust twinkles, light glints run over the swept black ice and the snow, wind in the dry reed clumps and the laden spruce, choughs cross the sky. No water ripples and no ducks (the lake is frozen); the snowy foreground has no front-plane grass layer any more. Winter life (art/tools/winter_ambient.py, w_* layers): skiers carve down the pistes under the lift, a snowcat crawls across the broad slope, snow plumes blow off the Chopok summit and the right ridge, powder sifts off the rowan twigs and the laden spruce, Adam's breath steams.",
